{"id":"b3e890b786b7e2b9626b87cbc8fe636d8b7ba5fe","axis":"silent","repo":"phpredis/phpredis","sha":"b3e890b786b7e2b9626b87cbc8fe636d8b7ba5fe","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"INSTALL.md","lines":["@@ -28,12 +28,14 @@ To build this extension for the sources tree:"," git clone https://github.com/phpredis/phpredis.git"," cd phpredis"," phpize","-./configure [--enable-redis-igbinary] [--enable-redis-msgpack] [--enable-redis-lzf [--with-liblzf[=DIR]]] [--enable-redis-zstd] [--enable-redis-lz4]","+./configure [--enable-redis-igbinary] [--enable-redis-msgpack] [--enable-redis-phpser] [--enable-redis-lzf [--with-liblzf[=DIR]]] [--enable-redis-zstd] [--enable-redis-lz4]"," make && make install"," ~~~"," "," If you would like phpredis to serialize your data using the igbinary library, run configure with `--enable-redis-igbinary`."," If you would like to use the msgpack serializer, run configure with `--enable-redis-msgpack` (note:  Requires php-msgpack >= 2.0.3)","+If you would like to use the [phpser](https://github.com/iliaal/phpser) serializer, run configure with `--enable-redis-phpser` (note: Requires phpser >= 0.9.0 and PHP >= 8.2). Load phpser before redis (`extension=phpser.so` above `extension=redis.so`).","+When `phpser.key` is set to a key of at least 32 bytes, `Redis::SERIALIZER_PHPSER` values are HMAC-signed for the `redis` context and verified before decoding. While `phpser.key` is set, a value that fails verification or does not decode is returned as `false`, never as its raw bytes, so plain values written by other clients or by `INCR` read back as `false` unless `Redis::OPT_PACK_IGNORE_NUMBERS` is enabled for numeric values. Without `phpser.key`, such values are returned as strings, as with igbinary and the PHP serializer."," The extension also may compress data before sending it to Redis server, if you run configure with `--enable-redis-lzf`. If you want to use lzf library pre-installed into your system use `--with-liblzf` configuration option to specify the path where to search files."," `make install` copies `redis.so` to an appropriate location, but you still need to enable the module in the PHP config file. To do so, either edit your php.ini or add a redis.ini file in `/etc/php5/conf.d` with the following contents: `extension=redis.so`."," "],"additions":3,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"README.md","lines":["@@ -463,6 +463,7 @@ $redis->setOption(Redis::OPT_SERIALIZER, Redis::SERIALIZER_PHP);\t  // Use built-"," $redis->setOption(Redis::OPT_SERIALIZER, Redis::SERIALIZER_IGBINARY); // Use igBinary serialize/unserialize"," $redis->setOption(Redis::OPT_SERIALIZER, Redis::SERIALIZER_MSGPACK);  // Use msgpack serialize/unserialize"," $redis->setOption(Redis::OPT_SERIALIZER, Redis::SERIALIZER_JSON);  // Use JSON to serialize/unserialize","+$redis->setOption(Redis::OPT_SERIALIZER, Redis::SERIALIZER_PHPSER);  // Use phpser serialize/unserialize (signed when phpser.key is set)"," "," $redis->setOption(Redis::OPT_PREFIX, 'myAppName:');\t// use custom prefix on all keys"," ","@@ -495,7 +496,8 @@ Parameter value."," ###### *Example*"," ~~~php"," // return Redis::SERIALIZER_NONE, Redis::SERIALIZER_PHP,","-//        Redis::SERIALIZER_IGBINARY, Redis::SERIALIZER_MSGPACK or Redis::SERIALIZER_JSON","+//        Redis::SERIALIZER_IGBINARY, Redis::SERIALIZER_MSGPACK, Redis::SERIALIZER_JSON","+//        or Redis::SERIALIZER_PHPSER"," $redis->getOption(Redis::OPT_SERIALIZER);"," ~~~"," "],"additions":3,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"common.h","lines":["@@ -158,7 +158,8 @@ typedef enum {","     REDIS_SERIALIZER_PHP,","     REDIS_SERIALIZER_IGBINARY,","     REDIS_SERIALIZER_MSGPACK,","-    REDIS_SERIALIZER_JSON","+    REDIS_SERIALIZER_JSON,","+    REDIS_SERIALIZER_PHPSER"," } redis_serializer;"," /* compression */"," #define REDIS_COMPRESSION_NONE 0"],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"composer.json","lines":["@@ -26,6 +26,10 @@","                 \"name\": \"enable-redis-igbinary\",","                 \"description\": \"Enable igbinary serializer support\"","             },","+            {","+                \"name\": \"enable-redis-phpser\",","+                \"description\": \"Enable phpser serializer support\"","+            },","             {","                 \"name\": \"enable-redis-msgpack\",","                 \"description\": \"Enable msgpack serializer support\""],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"config.m4","lines":["@@ -20,6 +20,9 @@ PHP_ARG_ENABLE(redis-json, whether to enable json serializer support,"," PHP_ARG_ENABLE(redis-igbinary, whether to enable igbinary serializer support,"," [  --enable-redis-igbinary Enable igbinary serializer support], no, no)"," ","+PHP_ARG_ENABLE(redis-phpser, whether to enable phpser serializer support,","+[  --enable-redis-phpser        Enable phpser serializer support], no, no)","+"," PHP_ARG_ENABLE(redis-msgpack, whether to enable msgpack serializer support,"," [  --enable-redis-msgpack       Enable msgpack serializer support], no, no)"," ","@@ -150,6 +153,45 @@ if test \"$PHP_REDIS\" != \"no\"; then","     AC_MSG_RESULT([disabled])","   fi"," ","+  if test \"$PHP_REDIS_PHPSER\" != \"no\"; then","+    AC_MSG_CHECKING([for phpser includes])","+    phpser_inc_path=\"\"","+","+    if test -f \"$abs_srcdir/include/php/ext/phpser/php_phpser_api.h\"; then","+      phpser_inc_path=\"$abs_srcdir/include/php\"","+    elif test -f \"$abs_srcdir/ext/phpser/php_phpser_api.h\"; then","+      phpser_inc_path=\"$abs_srcdir\"","+    elif test -f \"$phpincludedir/ext/phpser/php_phpser_api.h\"; then","+      phpser_inc_path=\"$phpincludedir\"","+    else","+      for i in php php7; do","+        if test -f \"$prefix/include/$i/ext/phpser/php_phpser_api.h\"; then","+          phpser_inc_path=\"$prefix/include/$i\"","+        fi","+      done","+    fi","+","+    if test \"$phpser_inc_path\" = \"\"; then","+      AC_MSG_ERROR([Cannot find php_phpser_api.h])","+    else","+      AC_MSG_RESULT([$phpser_inc_path])","+    fi","+  fi","+","+  AC_MSG_CHECKING([for redis phpser support])","+  if test \"$PHP_REDIS_PHPSER\" != \"no\"; then","+    AC_MSG_RESULT([enabled])","+    AC_DEFINE(HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER,1,[Whether redis phpser serializer is enabled])","+    PHPSER_EXT_DIR=\"$phpser_inc_path/ext\"","+    ifdef([PHP_ADD_EXTENSION_DEP],","+    [","+      PHP_ADD_EXTENSION_DEP(redis, phpser)","+    ])","+    PHP_ADD_INCLUDE($PHPSER_EXT_DIR)","+  else","+    AC_MSG_RESULT([disabled])","+  fi","+","   if test \"$PHP_REDIS_MSGPACK\" != \"no\"; then","     AC_MSG_CHECKING([for msgpack includes])","     msgpack_inc_path=\"\""],"additions":42,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"config.w32","lines":["@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@"," ARG_ENABLE(\"redis\", \"whether to enable redis support\", \"no\");\r"," ARG_ENABLE(\"redis-session\", \"whether to enable sessions\", \"yes\");\r"," ARG_ENABLE(\"redis-igbinary\", \"whether to enable igbinary serializer support\", \"no\");\r","+ARG_ENABLE(\"redis-phpser\", \"whether to enable phpser serializer support\", \"no\");\r"," \r"," if (PHP_REDIS != \"no\") {\r"," \tvar sources = \"redis.c redis_commands.c redis_cmd.c library.c redis_session.c redis_array.c redis_array_impl.c redis_cluster.c cluster_library.c redis_sentinel.c sentinel_library.c backoff.c\";","@@ -21,6 +22,20 @@ if (PHP_REDIS != \"no\") {"," \t\t\tWARNING(\"redis igbinary support not enabled\");\r"," \t\t}\r"," \t}\r","+\r","+\tif (PHP_REDIS_PHPSER != \"no\") {\r","+\t\tif (CHECK_HEADER_ADD_INCLUDE(\"php_phpser_api.h\", \"CFLAGS_REDIS\", configure_module_dirname + \"\\\\..\\\\phpser\")) {\r","+\r","+\t\t\tADD_EXTENSION_DEP(\"redis\", \"phpser\");\r","+\t\t\t// php_phpser_api.h selects dllimport only when COMPILE_DL_PHPSER is defined.\r","+\t\t\tif (typeof(PHP_PHPSER_SHARED) != \"undefined\" && PHP_PHPSER_SHARED) {\r","+\t\t\t\tADD_FLAG(\"CFLAGS_REDIS\", \"/D COMPILE_DL_PHPSER\");\r","+\t\t\t}\r","+\t\t\tAC_DEFINE(\"HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER\", 1);\r","+\t\t} else {\r","+\t\t\tWARNING(\"redis phpser support not enabled\");\r","+\t\t}\r","+\t}\r"," \tEXTENSION(\"redis\", sources);\r"," \r"," }\r"],"additions":15,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"library.c","lines":["@@ -16,6 +16,22 @@"," #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_MSGPACK"," #include \"msgpack/php_msgpack.h\""," #endif","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+#include \"phpser/php_phpser_api.h\"","+","+#define REDIS_PHPSER_CONTEXT \"redis\"","+","+/* phpser has no API that reports whether signing is active, so apply its own","+ * rule: a non-empty phpser.key means values must verify.  A key shorter than","+ * phpser accepts also counts, because phpser then rejects every value with a","+ * plain PHPSER_API_ERR, and the raw bytes behind it were never verified. */","+static int redis_phpser_signed(void) {","+    zend_ini_entry *entry = zend_hash_str_find_ptr(","+        EG(ini_directives), \"phpser.key\", sizeof(\"phpser.key\") - 1);","+","+    return entry && entry->value && ZSTR_LEN(entry->value) > 0;","+}","+#endif"," "," #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_LZF"," #include <lzf.h>","@@ -4314,6 +4330,19 @@ redis_pack(RedisSock *redis_sock, zval *z, char **val, size_t *val_len) {","     return tmpfree;"," }"," ","+static void","+redis_unserialize_or_copy(RedisSock *redis_sock, const char *src, size_t len,","+                          zval *zdst)","+{","+    int ret = redis_unserialize(redis_sock, src, len, zdst);","+","+    if (ret == 0) {","+        ZVAL_STRINGL_FAST(zdst, src, len);","+    } else if (ret < 0) {","+        ZVAL_FALSE(zdst);","+    }","+}","+"," PHP_REDIS_API int"," redis_unpack(RedisSock *redis_sock, const char *src, int srclen, zval *zdst) {","     zend_long lval;","@@ -4341,22 +4370,25 @@ redis_unpack(RedisSock *redis_sock, const char *src, int srclen, zval *zdst) {"," ","     /* Input string is empty */","     if (srclen == 0) {","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+        /* A signed value is never empty, so this one failed verification */","+        if (redis_sock->serializer == REDIS_SERIALIZER_PHPSER && redis_phpser_signed()) {","+            ZVAL_FALSE(zdst);","+            return 1;","+        }","+#endif","         ZVAL_STR(zdst, ZSTR_EMPTY_ALLOC());","         return 1;","     }"," ","     /* Uncompress, then unserialize */","     if (redis_uncompress(redis_sock, &buf, &len, src, srclen)) {","-        if (!redis_unserialize(redis_sock, buf, len, zdst)) {","-            ZVAL_STRINGL_FAST(zdst, buf, len);","-        }","+        redis_unserialize_or_copy(redis_sock, buf, len, zdst);","         efree(buf);","         return 1;","     }"," ","-    if (!redis_unserialize(redis_sock, src, srclen, zdst)) {","-        ZVAL_STRINGL_FAST(zdst, src, srclen);","-    }","+    redis_unserialize_or_copy(redis_sock, src, srclen, zdst);"," ","     return 1;"," }","@@ -4372,6 +4404,9 @@ redis_serialize(RedisSock *redis_sock, zval *z, char **val, size_t *val_len)","     size_t sz;","     uint8_t *val8;"," #endif","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+    zend_string *zstr;","+#endif"," ","     *val = \"\";","     *val_len = 0;","@@ -4429,6 +4464,19 @@ redis_serialize(RedisSock *redis_sock, zval *z, char **val, size_t *val_len)","                 *val_len = sz;","                 return 1;","             }","+#endif","+            break;","+        case REDIS_SERIALIZER_PHPSER:","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+            if (phpser_api_serialize(z, REDIS_PHPSER_CONTEXT,","+                                     sizeof(REDIS_PHPSER_CONTEXT) - 1,","+                                     &zstr) == PHPSER_API_OK)","+            {","+                *val = estrndup(ZSTR_VAL(zstr), ZSTR_LEN(zstr));","+                *val_len = ZSTR_LEN(zstr);","+                zend_string_release(zstr);","+                return 1;","+            }"," #endif","             break;","         case REDIS_SERIALIZER_JSON:","@@ -4501,6 +4549,19 @@ redis_unserialize(RedisSock* redis_sock, const char *val, int val_len,","             }"," ","             ret = !igbinary_unserialize((const uint8_t *)val, val_len, z_ret);","+#endif","+            break;","+        case REDIS_SERIALIZER_PHPSER:","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+            if (phpser_api_unserialize(val, val_len, REDIS_PHPSER_CONTEXT,","+                                       sizeof(REDIS_PHPSER_CONTEXT) - 1,","+                                       z_ret) == PHPSER_API_OK)","+            {","+                ret = 1;","+            } else if (redis_phpser_signed()) {","+                /* The raw bytes are what the signature exists to reject */","+                ret = -1;","+            }"," #endif","             break;","         case REDIS_SERIALIZER_JSON:"],"additions":67,"deletions":6,"truncated":false},{"path":"library.h","lines":["@@ -144,6 +144,8 @@ redis_key_prefix(RedisSock *redis_sock, char **key, size_t *key_len);"," PHP_REDIS_API zend_string *"," redis_key_prefix_zstr(RedisSock *redis_sock, zend_string *key);"," ","+/* Return 1 on success and 0 on failure. Return -1 on a failure where the input","+ * must not be handed back as a raw string, leaving z_ret undefined. */"," PHP_REDIS_API int"," redis_unserialize(RedisSock *redis_sock, const char *val, int val_len, zval *z_ret);"," "],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"package.xml","lines":["@@ -235,6 +235,7 @@ http://pear.php.net/dtd/package-2.0.xsd\">","     <configureoption name=\"enable-redis-lzf\" prompt=\"enable lzf compression support?\" default=\"no\"/>","     <configureoption name=\"enable-redis-zstd\" prompt=\"enable zstd compression support?\" default=\"no\"/>","     <configureoption name=\"enable-redis-msgpack\" prompt=\"enable msgpack serializer support?\" default=\"no\"/>","+    <configureoption name=\"enable-redis-phpser\" prompt=\"enable phpser serializer support?\" default=\"no\"/>","     <configureoption name=\"enable-redis-lz4\" prompt=\"enable lz4 compression?\" default=\"no\"/>","     <configureoption name=\"with-liblz4\" prompt=\"use system liblz4?\" default=\"yes\"/>","   </extsrcrelease>"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"redis.c","lines":["@@ -38,6 +38,11 @@"," "," #include \"library.h\""," ","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+#include <ext/standard/php_versioning.h>","+#include \"phpser/php_phpser_api.h\"","+#endif","+"," #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_ZSTD"," #include <zstd.h>"," #endif","@@ -117,6 +122,9 @@ static const zend_module_dep redis_deps[] = {"," #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_MSGPACK","      ZEND_MOD_REQUIRED(\"msgpack\")"," #endif","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+     ZEND_MOD_REQUIRED(\"phpser\")","+#endif"," #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_JSON","      ZEND_MOD_REQUIRED(\"json\")"," #endif","@@ -339,6 +347,32 @@ static void redis_init_object_handlers(void) {","     redis_object_handlers.clone_obj = NULL;"," }"," ","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+/* phpser_api_version() does not exist before phpser 0.9.0, so check the","+ * module version before calling into the API. */","+static int","+redis_check_phpser(void)","+{","+    const char *version = zend_get_module_version(\"phpser\");","+","+    if (version == NULL || php_version_compare(version, \"0.9.0\") < 0) {","+        php_error_docref(NULL, E_CORE_WARNING,","+            \"Redis::SERIALIZER_PHPSER requires phpser 0.9.0 or later, found %s\",","+            version ? version : \"none\");","+        return FAILURE;","+    }","+","+    if (phpser_api_version() != PHPSER_API_VERSION) {","+        php_error_docref(NULL, E_CORE_WARNING,","+            \"Redis::SERIALIZER_PHPSER requires phpser API version %d, found %u\",","+            PHPSER_API_VERSION, phpser_api_version());","+        return FAILURE;","+    }","+","+    return SUCCESS;","+}","+#endif","+"," /**","  * PHP_MINIT_FUNCTION","  */","@@ -346,6 +380,12 @@ PHP_MINIT_FUNCTION(redis)"," {","     struct timeval tv;"," ","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+    if (redis_check_phpser() == FAILURE) {","+        return FAILURE;","+    }","+#endif","+","     /* Seed random generator (for RedisCluster failover) */","     gettimeofday(&tv, NULL);","     srand(tv.tv_usec * tv.tv_sec);","@@ -396,35 +436,20 @@ PHP_MINIT_FUNCTION(redis)"," static const char *"," get_available_serializers(void)"," {","+    return \"php\""," #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_JSON","-    #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_IGBINARY","-        #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_MSGPACK","-            return \"php, json, igbinary, msgpack\";","-        #else","-            return \"php, json, igbinary\";","-        #endif","-    #else","-        #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_MSGPACK","-            return \"php, json, msgpack\";","-        #else","-            return \"php, json\";","-        #endif","-    #endif","-#else","-    #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_IGBINARY","-        #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_MSGPACK","-            return \"php, igbinary, msgpack\";","-        #else","-            return \"php, igbinary\";","-        #endif","-    #else","-        #ifdef HAVE_REDIS_MSGPACK","-            return \"php, msgpack\";","-        #else","-            return \"php\";","-        #endif","-    #endif","+        \", json\"","+#endif","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_IGBINARY","+        \", igbinary\"","+#endif","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_MSGPACK","+        \", msgpack\"","+#endif","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+        \", phpser\""," #endif","+        ;"," }"," "," /**"],"additions":52,"deletions":27,"truncated":false},{"path":"redis.stub.php","lines":["@@ -261,6 +261,20 @@ class Redis {","      */","     public const SERIALIZER_JSON = UNKNOWN;"," ","+#ifdef HAVE_REDIS_PHPSER","+    /**","+     * Sets the serializer to phpser. Note that PhpRedis must be compiled","+     * with phpser support to use this serializer. When `phpser.key` is set,","+     * values are HMAC-signed and a value that fails verification is returned","+     * as `false`.","+     *","+     * @var int","+     * @cvalue REDIS_SERIALIZER_PHPSER","+     *","+     */","+    public const SERIALIZER_PHPSER = UNKNOWN;","+#endif","+","     /**","      * Disables compression.","      *","@@ -4132,7 +4146,7 @@ public function setRange(string $key, int $index, string $value): Redis|int|fals","      * | --------------- | ---- | ----------- |","      * | OPT_MAX_RETRIES | int  | The maximum number of times Redis will attempt to reconnect if it gets disconnected, before throwing an exception. |","      * | OPT_SCAN        | enum | Redis::SCAN_RETRY, or Redis::SCAN_NORETRY.  Whether PhpRedis should automatically SCAN again when zero keys but a nonzero iterator are returned. |","-     * | OPT_SERIALIZER  | enum | Set the automatic data serializer.<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_NONE`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_PHP`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_IGBINARY`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_MSGPACK`, `Redis::SERIALIZER_JSON`|","+     * | OPT_SERIALIZER  | enum | Set the automatic data serializer.<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_NONE`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_PHP`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_IGBINARY`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_MSGPACK`, `Redis::SERIALIZER_JSON`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_PHPSER`|","      * | OPT_PREFIX | string | A string PhpRedis will use to prefix every key we read or write. |","      * | OPT_READ_TIMEOUT | float | How long PhpRedis will block for a response from Redis before throwing a 'read error on connection' exception. |","      * | OPT_TCP_KEEPALIVE | bool |   Set or disable TCP_KEEPALIVE on the connection. |"],"additions":15,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"redis_arginfo.h","lines":["@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@"," /* This is a generated file, edit the .stub.php file instead.","- * Stub hash: 702da70525cb89e3444713287350a4985fe88567 */","+ * Stub hash: 2de44845003c74a5972aaf8c15e80820ebd5dcfd */"," "," ZEND_BEGIN_ARG_INFO_EX(arginfo_class_Redis___construct, 0, 0, 0)"," \tZEND_ARG_TYPE_INFO_WITH_DEFAULT_VALUE(0, options, IS_ARRAY, 1, \"null\")","@@ -2135,6 +2135,14 @@ static zend_class_entry *register_class_Redis(void)"," \tzend_string *const_SERIALIZER_JSON_name = zend_string_init_interned(\"SERIALIZER_JSON\", sizeof(\"SERIALIZER_JSON\") - 1, 1);"," \tzend_declare_class_constant_ex(class_entry, const_SERIALIZER_JSON_name, &const_SERIALIZER_JSON_value, ZEND_ACC_PUBLIC, NULL);"," \tzend_string_release(const_SERIALIZER_JSON_name);","+#if defined(HAVE_REDIS_PHP